# Design system

## Tokens (CSS variables in `app/globals.css`)

Use semantic names: `background`, `surface`, `surface-muted`, `text-primary`, `accent-soft`, `success`, `warning`, `danger`.

Tailwind: `bg-background`, `bg-card`, `text-muted-foreground`, `bg-accent-soft`, `text-success`, `border-border`.

## Visual tone

Premium, calm, minimal — reference Apple Fitness, Whoop, Linear. Spacious padding, `rounded-2xl` cards, `shadow-sm`, soft borders.

## Typography

- Page title: `text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight`
- Section: `text-lg font-semibold`
- Meta: `text-sm text-muted-foreground`

## Accessibility

- Progress: text label + `aria-valuenow` / `role="progressbar"`
- Inputs: associated `<label>` or `aria-label`
- Checkboxes: `aria-label` describing set number and action

## Avoid

Bright gym neons, cluttered dashboards, dark bodybuilding aesthetic.
